{"id":57,"slug":"57-aria-la-gi","category":"HTML","subcategory":"Accessibility","level":"beginner","question_vi":"ARIA là gì?","question_en":"What is ARIA?","answer_vi":"ARIA (Accessible Rich Internet Applications) là bộ attribute **bổ sung ngữ nghĩa** cho screen reader khi HTML gốc không diễn tả đủ.\n\nBa nhóm:\n\n```html\n<!-- role: vai trò -->\n<div role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\">...</div>\n\n<!-- state: trạng thái, thay đổi theo tương tác -->\n<button aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"menu\">Menu</button>\n\n<!-- property: thuộc tính, thường cố định -->\n<input aria-label=\"Tìm kiếm\" aria-describedby=\"hint\">\n```\n\n**Quy tắc số 1 của ARIA: đừng dùng ARIA nếu HTML đã làm được.**\n\n```html\n<div role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" onkeydown=\"...\">Gửi</div>   <!-- phải tự viết lại mọi thứ -->\n<button>Gửi</button>                                        <!-- đã có sẵn tất cả -->\n```\n\nARIA **chỉ đổi cách screen reader mô tả**, không thêm hành vi: đặt `role=\"button\"` lên `<div>` không làm phím Enter hoạt động, không đưa nó vào tab order, không có trạng thái disabled.\n\n**Lưu ý:** ARIA sai còn tệ hơn không có ARIA. `aria-hidden=\"true\"` trên một nút đang focus được sẽ tạo ra phần tử \"tồn tại với bàn phím nhưng vô hình với screen reader\" — người dùng tab vào một chỗ không được đọc tên","answer_en":"ARIA (Accessible Rich Internet Applications) is a set of attributes that **add semantics** for screen readers when native HTML cannot express something.\n\nThree groups:\n\n```html\n<!-- role: what this is -->\n<div role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\">...</div>\n\n<!-- state: changes as the user interacts -->\n<button aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"menu\">Menu</button>\n\n<!-- property: usually fixed -->\n<input aria-label=\"Search\" aria-describedby=\"hint\">\n```\n\n**ARIA rule number one: do not use ARIA if HTML already does the job.**\n\n```html\n<div role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" onkeydown=\"...\">Submit</div>   <!-- reimplement everything -->\n<button>Submit</button>                                        <!-- all of it, for free -->\n```\n\nARIA **only changes how a screen reader describes something**; it adds no behavior. `role=\"button\"` on a `<div>` does not make Enter work, does not add it to the tab order and gives you no disabled state.\n\n**Note:** wrong ARIA is worse than no ARIA. `aria-hidden=\"true\"` on a focusable button creates an element that \"exists for the keyboard but is invisible to the screen reader\" — the user tabs into something that is never announced","answer_html_vi":"<p class=\"qa-summary\">ARIA (Accessible Rich Internet Applications) là bộ attribute <strong>bổ sung ngữ nghĩa</strong> cho screen reader khi HTML gốc không diễn tả đủ.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Ba nhóm:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">html</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"&lt;!-- role: vai trò --&gt;\n&lt;div role=&quot;dialog&quot; aria-modal=&quot;true&quot;&gt;...&lt;/div&gt;\n\n&lt;!-- state: trạng thái, thay đổi theo tương tác --&gt;\n&lt;button aria-expanded=&quot;false&quot; aria-controls=&quot;menu&quot;&gt;Menu&lt;/button&gt;\n\n&lt;!-- property: thuộc tính, thường cố định --&gt;\n&lt;input aria-label=&quot;Tìm kiếm&quot; aria-describedby=&quot;hint&quot;&gt;\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- role: vai trò --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">role</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;dialog&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">aria-modal</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;true&quot;</span>&gt;</span>...<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- state: trạng thái, thay đổi theo tương tác --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">button</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">aria-expanded</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;false&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">aria-controls</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;menu&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Menu<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">button</span>&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- property: thuộc tính, thường cố định --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">aria-label</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Tìm kiếm&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">aria-describedby</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;hint&quot;</span>&gt;</span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Quy tắc số 1 của ARIA: đừng dùng ARIA nếu HTML đã làm được.</strong></p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">html</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"&lt;div role=&quot;button&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot; onkeydown=&quot;...&quot;&gt;Gửi&lt;/div&gt;   &lt;!-- phải tự viết lại mọi thứ --&gt;\n&lt;button&gt;Gửi&lt;/button&gt;                                        &lt;!-- đã có sẵn tất cả --&gt;\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">role</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;button&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">tabindex</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;0&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">onkeydown</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;...&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Gửi<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>   <span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- phải tự viết lại mọi thứ --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">button</span>&gt;</span>Gửi<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">button</span>&gt;</span>                                        <span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- đã có sẵn tất cả --&gt;</span></code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\">ARIA <strong>chỉ đổi cách screen reader mô tả</strong>, không thêm hành vi: đặt <code>role=\"button\"</code> lên <code>&lt;div&gt;</code> không làm phím Enter hoạt động, không đưa nó vào tab order, không có trạng thái disabled.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\"><strong>Lưu ý:</strong> ARIA sai còn tệ hơn không có ARIA. <code>aria-hidden=\"true\"</code> trên một nút đang focus được sẽ tạo ra phần tử \"tồn tại với bàn phím nhưng vô hình với screen reader\" — người dùng tab vào một chỗ không được đọc tên.</p>","answer_html_en":"<p class=\"qa-summary\">ARIA (Accessible Rich Internet Applications) is a set of attributes that <strong>add semantics</strong> for screen readers when native HTML cannot express something.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Three groups:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">html</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"&lt;!-- role: what this is --&gt;\n&lt;div role=&quot;dialog&quot; aria-modal=&quot;true&quot;&gt;...&lt;/div&gt;\n\n&lt;!-- state: changes as the user interacts --&gt;\n&lt;button aria-expanded=&quot;false&quot; aria-controls=&quot;menu&quot;&gt;Menu&lt;/button&gt;\n\n&lt;!-- property: usually fixed --&gt;\n&lt;input aria-label=&quot;Search&quot; aria-describedby=&quot;hint&quot;&gt;\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- role: what this is --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">role</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;dialog&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">aria-modal</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;true&quot;</span>&gt;</span>...<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- state: changes as the user interacts --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">button</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">aria-expanded</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;false&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">aria-controls</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;menu&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Menu<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">button</span>&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- property: usually fixed --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">aria-label</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Search&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">aria-describedby</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;hint&quot;</span>&gt;</span></code></pre></div><p><strong>ARIA rule number one: do not use ARIA if HTML already does the job.</strong></p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">html</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"&lt;div role=&quot;button&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot; onkeydown=&quot;...&quot;&gt;Submit&lt;/div&gt;   &lt;!-- reimplement everything --&gt;\n&lt;button&gt;Submit&lt;/button&gt;                                        &lt;!-- all of it, for free --&gt;\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">role</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;button&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">tabindex</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;0&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">onkeydown</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;...&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Submit<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>   <span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- reimplement everything --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">button</span>&gt;</span>Submit<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">button</span>&gt;</span>                                        <span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- all of it, for free --&gt;</span></code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\">ARIA <strong>only changes how a screen reader describes something</strong>; it adds no behavior. <code>role=\"button\"</code> on a <code>&lt;div&gt;</code> does not make Enter work, does not add it to the tab order and gives you no disabled state.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\"><strong>Note:</strong> wrong ARIA is worse than no ARIA. <code>aria-hidden=\"true\"</code> on a focusable button creates an element that \"exists for the keyboard but is invisible to the screen reader\" — the user tabs into something that is never announced.</p>","references":[{"label":"MDN — ARIA","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/Accessibility/ARIA"},{"label":"W3C — Using ARIA: rules of ARIA use","url":"https://www.w3.org/TR/using-aria/"}],"related":[{"url":"/q/3-the-doctype-la-gi-tai-sao-can-khai-bao-doctype","title":"Thẻ DOCTYPE là gì? Tại sao cần khai báo DOCTYPE?"},{"url":"/q/4-cau-truc-co-ban-cua-mot-tai-lieu-html-bao-gom-nhung-gi","title":"Cấu trúc cơ bản của một tài liệu HTML bao gồm những gì?"},{"url":"/q/8-block-level-element-va-inli